# Infinity Protocol Testing Standards v8.4.0
> Forged from: AZDJ Academy E2E Protocol, ecommerce.mdc mandates, Infinity Constitution
> Last updated: 2026-03-20

---

## 1. Separation of Concerns

| Tool | Role |
|---|---|
| **Vitest** | Unit + Component tests — pure logic, no browser |
| **Playwright** | E2E — full user flows, Firebase emulator, browser UI |
| **@firebase/rules-unit-testing** | Firestore/Storage security rule verification only |

---

## 2. Mandatory Test Coverage (Cannot Skip)

- **Authentication Flows** — login, OAuth, sign-out, token refresh, route guards
- **Financial/Checkout** — cart math, price calculation, Stripe webhook security
- **Database Mutators** — any Cloud Function, Firestore write, or state sync
- **Gemini Embedding** — `dv gemini-audit` before every deploy (exit 0 required)
- **Firestore Security Rules** — both `assertSucceeds` and `assertFails` cases

---

## 3. Unit Testing (Vitest)

- Tests adjacent to source: `calculateTotal.ts` → `calculateTotal.test.ts`
- Mock all externals: `vi.mock('firebase/firestore')`, `vi.mock('@/lib/embeddingService')`
- Component tests: rendering + local state ONLY — no routing, no real Firebase
- Zod schema validation tests in `__tests__/integrity/`
- Zero `any` types in test data payloads

---

## 4. E2E Testing (Playwright) — AZDJ Battle-Tested Rules

### Setup
```bash
# Emulator MUST run before any E2E test (verified from AZDJ protocol)
nohup firebase emulators:start --project=<PROJECT_ID> \
  --only firestore,functions,auth,storage \
  > /tmp/infinity-emulator.log 2>&1 &
# Wait ~40s, verify: curl http://127.0.0.1:8080/ → "Ok"
```

### playwright.config.ts non-negotiables
```typescript
export default defineConfig({
  workers: process.env.CI ? 1 : 3,        // NEVER auto-detect on Apple Silicon
  use: {
    trace: 'off',                           // Off by default — enable only on debug
    video: 'off',                           // NEVER emit video locally (fills disk)
    baseURL: 'http://127.0.0.1:5173',       // NEVER hardcode port in tests
  },
});
```

### File structure
```
/tests/e2e/
  notifications.spec.ts     ← Cloud Function email triggers (REST API pattern)
  checkout-flow.spec.ts     ← Full order path
  auth-flows.spec.ts        ← Login, signup, declined card, persistence
  firestore-rules.spec.ts   ← Security rules negative cases
  seo-audit.spec.ts         ← All pages load, meta tags, broken links
  a11y.spec.ts              ← axe-playwright accessibility
  mobile-layout.spec.ts     ← Responsive breakpoints
  visual.spec.ts            ← Screenshot regression (Liquid Glass hero)
```

