## 6. Firestore Security Rules Contract (Minimum Standard)

| Collection | Anon Create | Anon Read | Anon Delete | Notes |
|---|---|---|---|---|
| `leads` | ✅ | ❌ 403 | ❌ 403 | Update allowed; Admin read |
| `contacts` | ✅ | ❌ 403 | ❌ 403 | Admin only |
| `orders` | ❌ 403 | ❌ 403 | ❌ 403 | Auth + owner or admin |
| `carts` | ❌ 403 | ❌ 403 | ❌ 403 | Auth + owner only |
| `users` | ❌ 403 | ❌ 403 | ❌ 403 | Auth + own uid only |
| `e2e_mock_emails` | ✅ | ✅ | ✅ | Test env only — **never deploy open rules to prod** |
| `*` (catch-all) | ❌ 403 | ❌ 403 | ❌ 403 | Default deny |

Test both directions: `assertSucceeds` (authorized) and `assertFails` (unauthorized).

